 just their  sheer strength and should anyone want to  test that  let's just say they won't be  participating in any raids anytime soon  the black dot is a deadly and dangerous  force in apparent if their numbers and  strength aren't intimidating enough you  also have to remember who their leader  is  our last faction is located in the air  room and while the air roam has the  black tide it also houses the neoc  falcon years before the war times were  used to help travelers go from place to  place and defend them but during war  they can use their exquisite eyesight  which can sight enemies from miles away  the adepts are the high priests of neoc  they're from all walks of life artisans  farmers or dew catchers all of whom who  picked up the mace and became part of  the warrior pack the wind carvers and  pulverizers are more like your upgraded  versions of the previous ranks  pulverizers carry conomos instead of  maces to overpower their opponent's  strength and leave them vulnerable  while wind carvers harness magical  powers to bring high winds and storms to  the battlefield  they believe this is how the gods appear  to them so they do this in a way in  theory so that they can fight side by  side with their gods and anything that  they come across  shield guardians are even tougher than  the previous mentioned troops  whose sole job is to protect the temples  and relics of their gods  their defense is absolutely unmatched  just shown off by how large their shield  is  and if that wasn't enough there is only  a select amount of warriors who will  become a part of the cult of feasts  should one become a part of them they  will gain immense power through non-stop  eating  these are the neoc summoners the reason  they're able to live is due to the  ritual that allows their body to  overcome the stress of excessive eating  the niak has always been an interesting  group it's a religious group made up of  many different types of people and  troops who just want to preserve their  faith and do what they believe is right  with in their own faith and belief these  are all the factions and godfall  currently in 2020  should there be a new faction i'll make  a future video covering that new faction  in depth just like this before we leave  though i do want to leave you off with  an interesting question  assuming all five of the factions we  just mentioned all fought one another at  the same time who would you think would  emerge victorious let me know what you  think in the comments down below  with that though thank you for watching  the video like to view if you do enjoy  subscribe for more future godfall  content and goodbye  [Music]  you

